tton\"\n          ?disabled=\n          @click=[fn]\n        >\n          <ha-icon icon=\"mdi:play-circle-outline\"></ha-icon>\n          Start Now\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"arm-caption\">Arm is single-use - it's consumed the moment you press Start, or if the attempt is rejected.</p>\n    \n    \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n        </div>\n      </ha-card>\n    ",
 "side-by-side-armed-and-active": "\n      <ha-card>\n        <h1 class=\"card-title\">Energy Actions</h1>\n        <div class=\"actions-grid\">\n          \n      <div class=\"tile free-power-tile state-interlocked\">\n        <div class=\"tile-header\">\n          <div class=\"tile-heading\">\n            <ha-icon class=\"tile-icon\" icon=mdi:lock-outline></ha-icon>\n            <span class=\"tile-name\">Free Power</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"state-pill state-interlocked\">Interlocked</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"free-power-body\">\n          \n      <div class=\"schedule-banner\">\n        <ha-icon icon=\"mdi:calendar-clock\"></ha-icon>\n        <div class=\"schedule-banner-text\">\n          <div class=\"schedule-banner-line\">\n            Sun 15 Nov • 02:00 • 4.00 kW • 1h 30m\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"schedule-banner-countdown\">Starts in 16h 57m</div>\n        </div>\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          class=\"schedule-cancel-button\"\n          @click=[fn]\n        >\n          Cancel\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    \n          \n      <div class=\"interlock-banner\">\n        <ha-icon icon=\"mdi:lock-outline\"></ha-icon>\n        <div class=\"interlock-banner-text\">Dump to Grid currently owns inverter control.</div>\n      </div>\n    \n\n          \n      \n      <div class=\"mode-selector\" role=\"tablist\">\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          role=\"tab\"\n          class=\"mode-tab is-active\"\n          aria-selected=\n          @click=[fn]\n        >\n          <ha-icon icon=\"mdi:flash\"></ha-icon> Now\n        </button>\n        <button\n          type=\"button\"\n          role=\"tab\"\n          class=\"mode-tab \"\n          aria-selected=\n          @click=[fn]\n        >\n          <ha-icon icon=\"mdi:calendar-clock\"></ha-icon> Later\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    \n      \n      <p class=\"tile-description\">Charge the battery from free